      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hebron%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A sawmill known as the Bark River Mills was completed in Hebron during the winter of 1836 and 1837.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hebron%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Enoch G. Darling built a framed mill house in 1837, which was the first framed building erected in the county.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
